WEBVTT

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.690
Today's snack is a castella.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.560
You want something salty after 
you eat something sweet.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.470
What?!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.970
Plunk.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:37.680
Clack, clack.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.310
Chew, chew, chew...

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.730
You want something sweet after 
you eat something salty.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.850
I know!

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:57.770
Chew, chew.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:11.170
Now I can eat forever.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:13.960
This isn't good!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.020
<b>Former Angel With Wings.</b>

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:51.980
Well then, your Highness,

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:56.230
I'll put the details together 
for the inspection in writing.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.820
Thank you.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.750
<i>Lunch time.</i>

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:04.070
<i>Mullin has come to a café with 
Beelzebub while doing some work.</i>

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:05.970
I'm sorry about this.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:11.370
I'm sure it feels like work to you, 
having to eat lunch with a superior.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.220
No, it's a new experience. It's fun.

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:15.590
Really?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.580
I'm glad.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:25.550
Yum.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:30.240
<i>You know she's a serious person at her core.</i>

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.650
<i>I never thought I'd be having 
lunch with her Highness alone.</i>

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.540
<i>I don't feel worthy.</i>

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.570
U-Um...

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.580
The atmosphere is nice here.

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:47.810
Gocchin told me about this place.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.850
Really?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.020
Here you are.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.380
The parfait dessert you ordered.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:15.600
Is it good?

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.690
It is!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.230
Your Highness, you have some on your cheek.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.040
Act like you never saw that.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.540
<b>mumble
mumble</b>

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.750
You don't have to get so embarrassed.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.000
Oh, Mullin! You have some 
dust on your shoulder!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.250
Huh?

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:35.710
You're right.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.170
<i>Fluffy...</i>

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.100
You can't have it.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.760
You don't have to be so desperate.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.960
<i>It looked quite fluffy.</i>

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.510
I'll give it to you next 
time I find some dust.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.280
It's a promise, Mullin!

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.530
Uh-huh.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:57.400
<i>I never thought I'd get to 
spend my lunch like this.</i>

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.050
<i>Her Highness seems like 
she's having fun, too.</i>

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.530
Say "Ah"!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.980
Ah!

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:03.960
Is it good?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.530
Yeah! Give me another bite!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:10.240
<i>It's my first time seeing someone 
actually do the "Say 'Ah!'" thing!</i>

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.490
<i>It's the big city, after all.</i>

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.870
<i>This isn't just a café 
with a good atmosphere.</i>

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.300
<i>It might be a date spot with good atmosphere!</i>

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:19.420
<i>This isn't good. I'm all embarrassed now.</i>

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.720
P-Pretty crazy.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:24.940
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.810
You want some, too, Mullin?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.310
<i>No way!</i>

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.540
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.510
<i>It's her Highness we're talking about,</i>

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:42.820
<i>so I'm sure she really just
wants me to have some.</i>

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.040
<i>But I mean that's her spoon.</i>

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.570
<i>Is it okay for me to just eat off her spoon?</i>

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.920
<i>Am I weird for thinking about that?</i>

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.640
<i>Is this normal?</i>

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:58.030
<i>I've only ever shared
utensils with my mom.</i>

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:00.080
Hey, I was using that cup!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.530
I'm your mom. Who cares?

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.150
You worry too much.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.250
Of course I would!

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.260
If you don't want any, that's fine.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:11.760
Nom

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:15.780
I'm sorry.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.690
<i>That made me nervous.</i>

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.520
<b>Chew
Chew</b>

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:22.650
<b>Chew
Chew</b>

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:29.320
Now that I see her up close, 
she's really pretty.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.340
I mean, I usually have no clue 
what she's thinking, but...

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.250
<b>Hmph</b>

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.420
You already turned me down, 
so I'm not giving you any.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.850
<i>She's so cute!</i>

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:43.960
<i>That gap in personality.</i>

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.800
That was a nice change of pace.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.550
I'm kind of tired.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.260
What's with the commotion?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.310
Huh?

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.180
An angel? He has wings.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:05.440
It's the happiest day in my life, 
meeting an angel like you.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.190
I'm a demon.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.450
<i>They're not wings. He put those on...</i>

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.060
Bel!

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.520
Beelzebub!

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.660
Does he know you?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:17.850
I've missed you.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:20.000
Your big brother's been so busy.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.510
Big brother?

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:23.800
He's her Highness' big brother?!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:27.090
Well, more like a "big brother" 
type of relationship.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.090
Type of relationship?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.880
<i>What a creep...</i>

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.170
<i>She looks genuinely upset.</i>

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.240
Mullin, this is Astaroth, a former angel.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.890
You can be more friendly than that.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.990
I'm your older brother, right?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.610
<b>Former Seraph, Demon
Astaroth</b>

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>He's a big shot.</i>

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:50.570
Um, Astaroth-sama, 
what's up with those wings?

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:51.970
These?

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.080
The girls love them.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.780
They bring out more of 
my beauty, as well.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.550
I see...

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.120
<i>What kind of pick-up tactic is that?</i>

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.500
Also...

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.330
Bel, come on.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:06.970
She's trying super hard to hold back.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:09.380
<i>Stuck between desire and reason.</i>

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.090
So are you Bel's new assistant?

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.410
Y-Yes, my name is Mullin.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.020
I've heard rumors.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.730
You're a lot more boring-looking 
that I thought.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:19.970
I see...

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.520
Maybe you could borrow these.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.520
They might spruce you up a bit.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.440
I'm fine.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:30.150
I have no clue if the ladies would like 
you any more if you put them on, though.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.430
So fluffy...

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.970
Hey, Bel! That's no fair!

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.370
<i>And she changes her tune.</i>

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:42.450
I can't believe that Bel likes 
that shrimp more than me.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.350
Damn you! How did you manage to win Bel over?!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:46.210
Was it fluffy stuff?!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.930
You used some crazy fluffy 
stuff to get her, didn't you?!

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.220
What do you mean, "crazy fluffy stuff"?

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.730
I haven't done anything!

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:54.630
I adore Bel so much more.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.090
I traded diaries with her everyday!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.090
Here's today's
entry

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.390
I sang her lullabies!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.120
And during the war between Hell and Heaven,

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.300
Bel sided with Lucifer, 
so I fell to Hell with her!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.350
<i>Pretty strong love.</i>

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.670
When I first met her...

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:11.420
Yes, it was when we were both angels still...

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:20.700
Fluffy.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:21.900
Fluffy.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:29.160
She was so focused on tearing off pieces 
of clouds and feeling their fluffiness,

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.470
and when I saw her like that,

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.540
I just knew I had to protect her.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.130
I was really into that back then.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.540
Your Highness...

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:41.600
<i>Still, I'm curious what she was 
like when she was an angel...</i>

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.060
Bel back then was pretty cute.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.830
She's cute now, too, though.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.480
Let go of me.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.190
Mullin, let's go home.

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.600
I have to get back, too.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:53.900
My subordinates are
going to kill me.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:00.960
Mullin?

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.220
What's wrong?

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.580
Oh, nothing.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.420
I was just thinking you 
two look good together.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.040
You're both rather attractive, so you know...

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.060
Huh?

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.010
Really?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.720
You've got good taste, Mirin-kun.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.000
It's Mullin.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:24.630
I didn't expect him to tell it like it is.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.030
Mullin, I'm sorry.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.830
I'm going to go home by myself.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:31.520
Your Highness!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.160
Wait!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:32.720
Hold on.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.200
I'll go.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:34.780
Huh?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:37.490
You head back on your own.

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.160
Bel, what's wrong?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.800
Leave me alone.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.630
Did you get mad because I'm so persistent?

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:39.260
Sorry, I was just so happy to see you again.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:41.840
No, that's not it.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.300
Why, then?

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.630
I don't know.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:52.800
I don't know, but when Mullin 
said we looked good together...

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:55.940
I don't know why, but it made me sad.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.740
I guess you hate me that much, huh?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:09.740
I had a good time eating lunch with Mullin,

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:12.710
and then I got really sad...

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.130
Wh-What do you want?

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.590
Bel, you're cute.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.190
You really are.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:28.780
You've become really cute since 
the last time I saw you.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.660
Your brother's kind of lonely over here.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.530
Again, who ever said you're my brother?

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.200
I'll see you later.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.880
You should get back to work.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.750
No problem.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.700
Mullin, huh?

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.060
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.660
Welcome back.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.290
Where did you go?

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.350
I was worried.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.030
I'm sorry.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.750
Your Highness, next time we go
on a visitation again,

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.140
let's go to lunch.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.520
Huh?

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:32.830
Sure!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.240
Now, let's get to work.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.750
We have stuff to do this 
afternoon, your Highness.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:41.980
Right...

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:55.530
<i>Hell, that is where demons do their duty.</i>

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.700
This plum kombu tea is really good.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.210
I'm glad you like it.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:10.410
I thought it'd be good to have 
 for when you get peckish.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:15.240
<i>Pandemonium is the 
administrative body for Hell.</i>

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:19.060
<i>The staff are, in fact, public servants
of the demon world.</i>

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.290
I'd like some cocoa.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.980
I'll have milk tea.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.480
I'll have a matcha latte.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.380
Go away.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:32.390
<b>The Assistant, a Complete Sadist.</b>

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.290
Bye!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.850
<i>The assistants in Pandemonium...</i>

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.130
<i>They're like secretaries or aides.</i>

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:47.320
<i>They're the closest assistants to 
the lords they're assigned to.</i>

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.280
<i>Mullin is Bel's new assistant.</i>

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.280
<i>He's dull.</i>

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:56.260
<i>I mean, he's just your typical guy.</i>

00:14:56.260 --> 00:15:00.790
<i>But it might be better than someone 
with too much personality.</i>

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.300
<i>If it was some cooler knight-like guy...</i>

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.980
I want to protect you from 
the acidity in plumb tea.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.590
<b>Lifts her chin for some reason</b>

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:11.500
What are you talking about?

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.570
If he was someone that 
acted more as her butler...

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.230
<b>Gets on top of her for no reason</b>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.380
Here's your plum kombu tea.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.230
Who are you?

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:28.480
Mirin, I'm glad you're boring!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.860
Are you trying to insult me?

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.450
Here's your cocoa.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.570
You actually got it for me?

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.260
I guess I did.

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.580
<i>He's nice.</i>

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.880
Your Highness, regarding our
upcoming plans on this matter...

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:55.260
<i>He plans ahead.</i>

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.010
That's a cute pen.

00:15:58.320 --> 00:15:59.720
I got it yesterday.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.590
You've got good taste, your Highness.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.440
<i>Gives women compliments without thinking...</i>

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:08.070
<i>Hold on... He might have really 
good boyfriend potential.</i>

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.530
<b><i>Boyfriend Potential</i></b>

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.050
<i>Boyfriend Potential Scouter.</i>

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.380
<i>Hold on a second. That's all normal.</i>

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:16.070
<i>I walk on the vehicle side
of the road and stuff, too.</i>

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.990
<i>I notice right away when a girl cuts her hair, too.</i>

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:22.060
Your Highness, did you take 
a look at these documents?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.480
I was about to do that.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:28.370
She doesn't want to do it, 
now that she was told about it, huh?

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.340
What's this hedgehog doing here?!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.320
You've brought in yet another thing.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.050
Who's going to take care of it?

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.260
But its stomach is all soft.

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.770
Put it back where you found it!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.730
No, this is "Mom Potential"!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:42.890
<b><i>Boyfriend Potential</i></b>

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:43.140
<b><i>Big Brother Potential</i></b>

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.730
<b><i>Mom Potential</i></b>

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.170
Now I'm not worried.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.220
<i>Mom Potential Scouter.</i>

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.780
<i>Today's snack is strawberry daifuku.</i>

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.190
<b>Pandemonium
Staff Store</b>

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.870
<b>Blah</b>

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:04.520
What's wrong? Why are you upset?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.970
Because you're so persistent.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.460
You're cute when you're mad, too.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.130
You sounded like a cat just now.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.800
She doesn't like you because you're so clingy.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.570
I get clingy because she's so cute.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:19.890
Yeah, but...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.320
You should just leave instead 
of making your home here.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:27.330
I'll leave if Bel comes to my office.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:31.160
I don't want to work unless I'm with girls.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.350
You already have a girl 
that'll stay with you.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.320
Really?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.650
She's my assistant!

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.300
She's cute.

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.330
No, she isn't!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.830
Even the demons of Cocytus would
run from her butt-naked!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.750
She's cold-hearted and...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.420
I've found you.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:54.880
Astaroth-sama, I've come to get you.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.210
Sacchan, I give! I give!

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:01.500
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.600
I will not.

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:04.960
What's going on?!

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:05.980
She fired a gun, right?

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.050
Your Highness, Beelzebub,

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:10.960
I'm sorry that my idiot master 
has caused you trouble.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.070
I will take him back.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.600
Thank you.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.990
Your Highness, who is she?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:21.010
She's Astaroth's guardian, Sargatanas.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.160
<b>Finance Department
Sargatanas</b>

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.020
This is not a proper guardian!

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.160
She's a crazy, psycho guardian!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.270
What was that?

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:30.380
A crazy, good guardian?

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.080
Now, apologize to everyone.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.590
That shouldn't be the attitude 
you have towards your superior.

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.710
What's up with their relationship...

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.550
<i>Extremely intense assistant power.</i>

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:44.120
What are you going to do about this?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.290
It's fine.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.480
I'll make arrangements to 
compensate immediately.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.330
I'm with the finance department.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:54.880
I have prepared a special secret fund 
for damages to facilities that occur

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.650
when I have to retrieve Astaroth.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.290
You expect to cause damage?!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:02.280
But couldn't you take him back more peacefully?

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.120
I enjoy doing it this way.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:04.930
<i>She admitted it.</i>

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:05.990
<i>What refreshing honesty.</i>

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.460
<i>Sargatanas-san is quite cool and collected.</i>

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.330
<i>She's rather tough with her superior.</i>

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.850
<i>She's kind of scary, but kind of cool, too.</i>

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.130
<i>Cool, but in a different way from Bro.</i>

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.510
<b>Paaaaaa</b>

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.110
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to scare you!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:27.930
There, there!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.880
Don't you feel bad for me up here?

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:31.260
Why are you...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.980
And kind of like Bro, in a way!

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:40.350
I ask that you do not tell any 
other staff about my hobbies.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.360
Okay, I won't!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.800
Hey, Sacchan...

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:48.370
I'd be happy if you could 
be nicer to me, too.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:48.870
What?

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:54.470
Well, it'd be nice if you 
could, at least, smile a bit.

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.590
He acts like he reports to her...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.340
It'd be nice if you could just 
say "let's go back" nicely.

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:02.730
Let's go back.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:02.760
<b>Smile...</b>

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:03.800
<i>Scary!</i>

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:09.140
I could see getting tied up if I was a girl.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:12.120
It'd look good, then, at least!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.270
Stop thinking about her Highness!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:20.880
Well, some girls wouldn't look good, though.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.200
<i>Completely flat.</i>

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.560
You shouldn't watch, your Highness.

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:25.160
Huh?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.180
He's really dumb.

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.790
Excuse us, your Highness.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.470
See you later, Bel.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.050
Don't come back now, ya hear?

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:42.790
<i>Maybe he was running from that girl,</i>

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.600
<i>and not trying to cozy up here.</i>

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.880
You said she was cute,

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.030
but she's a complete sadist...

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:53.000
I mean, Sargatanas-san 
was calm and collected.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.890
Sargatanas, huh?

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.780
She's cute.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.360
Walk quickly.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.820
I'm not your dog on a walk.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.700
Dogs are smarter than you.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.080
That's mean.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:17.410
Well, you always find me.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.520
I like you, Sacchan.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.880
I-I don't do it for you.

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:31.300
It's for our work.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.560
Uh-huh.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:35.740
You're really dumb.

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:37.480
Why's that?

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.020
Mullin!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.330
Get me more plum kombu tea!

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.590
You're drinking too much!

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:45.590
You won't be able to eat dinner!

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:18.660
<b>Don't touch</b>

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:18.660
<b>Don't use now</b>

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:25.420
<b>Hehehehe</b>

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:25.900
If I can't drink it, I'll 
try making my own plum kombu tea.

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:32.630
I'm not sure what to do next.

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:35.010
<i>That's not right.</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Fly! Imaginary Wings.</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Her Highness Checking in
on Someone Sick for the First Time.</b>

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:38.020
Watch us next time.
